Depends: libqt6widgets6t64, libqt6network6t64, libqt6gui6t64, libqt6core6t64, libgl1, libc6
Description: IP Inspector Pro - Network IP information tool
 Qt6 desktop application that shows local and public IP addresses (IPv4 and
 IPv6), geolocation, MAC addresses, hostnames and all network interfaces
 with a live filter, dark/light themes and system tray support.
